{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方最大号的白色主句，紫色强调词很醒目；随后容易被中部第二块蓝白色大字吸引。上下两块主句都具有较强视觉权重。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"仍被过去的人际委屈牵扯，似乎已经不在那些人身边，但具体处境还不够确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、难受，带有失落感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"不服气如何逐渐消退、离开那些人后为什么反而难受，这层前后因果需要读完整句子才能确认。小字中关于怀念对象可能是某个人或故乡的说明也不容易第一眼获得。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大号主句都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"单块主句较长，包含好几层意思，需要扫过整句才能理解情绪变化。\",\n    \"核心意思需要结合上下两块主句，才能比较完整地理解过去的委屈、如今不在身边和当前难受之间的关系。\",\n    \"辅助小字连续堆叠，需要在多行信息中挑选。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bedbfa90-61a4-404e-b957-262b8d7cd843", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T023027516479Z", "elapsed_seconds": 36.704, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:31:04.215555+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eba2c7ed745d1dfcbf6f0399ee76b01b101f330f3f712e0465ca7446b2135027", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144